# A359336

Irregular triangle read by rows: the n-th row lists the values 0..2^n-1 representing all subsets of a set of n elements. When its elements are linearly ordered, the subsets are sorted first by their size and then lexicographically.

The 89 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

